+          - (nonexistent_chdir.msg ~ (nonexistent_chdir.stdout | default('')) ~ (nonexistent_chdir.stderr | default(''))) is search "cd.*/nonexistent_dir"
+
+    - name: request sudo chdir to /; cwd should successfully be / before sudo runs
